# "Whenever an opponent searches their library" (CR 701.23, 701.23f). Bot1's Wan Shi Tong sees Bot2's Demonic Tutor search
# Bot2's own library (+1/+1 counter and a card), but not Bot2's Deadly Cover-Up searching BOT1's library for Ornithopters:
# that opponent is not searching "their" library, so the counter stays at one. Yavimaya Hollow regenerates Wan Shi Tong
# (and Bot1's Ornithopter dies) in response to the Cover-Up, which would otherwise destroy it. Bot1 exiled: Griselbrand and
# Ornithopters; the one in Bot1's hand draws it a card.

